# Leave unset to run LinkCard on the built-in localStorage backend (no
# setup needed, but cards only work on the device that created them).
#
# Set this to your deployed Worker's URL to use the real cross-device
# backend instead (see /worker/README.md for how to deploy it):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LINKCARD_API_URL=https://linkcard-api.your-subdomain.workers.dev
